# Antigravity AI Project Rules & Token Optimization Guidelines

# 1. Context Efficiency & Focus
- Always prioritize the latest user request in the current turn.
- Perform targeted file reads (`view_file` with precise line ranges or targeted `grep_search`) rather than reading entire large files into context.
- Use `replace_file_content` for precise line replacements instead of rewriting whole files.

# 2. Silent & Efficient Operations
- Inspect build logs, test logs, and git outputs silently and present only high-level concise summaries to the user.
- Keep responses concise, clean, and structured in Uzbek.

# 3. Code Precision
- Do not mutate unrelated logic or clear existing docstrings/comments.
- Always run build/typecheck commands after modifying code to verify correctness immediately.
